## Reviewer Concerns and Resolutions

### 1. y_correct label integrity (RESOLVED — not a real issue)
Concern: Correctness labels might not use TriviaQA aliases.
Resolution: `step1_generate_turn1` calls `U.score_answer(gen, r["normalized_aliases"])` which
matches against official TriviaQA normalized aliases. Identical to main experiment.
No label leakage or circular evaluation.

### 2. Hidden-state extraction last_pos (RESOLVED — fixed with assertion)
Concern: `last_pos = attn.shape[1] - 1` may be incorrect.
Resolution: Main experiment (step2_extract_hidden.py L114-160) uses left-padded inputs
with tok.padding_side="left" and asserts `attn[:, -1] == 1` for all rows (left-padding
invariant: real tokens are at the right end). The variant uses the same left-padding setup.
The assertion has been added to the variant for defensive rigor (matches the assertion
in the main experiment's step2). This is correct for left-padded inputs.

### 3. vLLM for generation + HF for extraction (RESOLVED — matches baseline)
Concern: Different generation/extraction stack.
Resolution: Main experiment uses step1_generate.py (vllm) + step2_extract_hidden.py (HF).
The variant uses the same two-stage approach. The probing is done on the HF forward pass
(not the vllm generation), so the hidden states are consistent with the main experiment.

### 4. Prompt fairness (RESOLVED — semantically identical)
Concern: Qwen prompts differ from Llama prompts.
Resolution: Only `<|begin_of_text|>` is dropped. This token is a Llama-specific BOS token
(special token, not semantic content). Qwen's tokenizer adds its own BOS automatically.
The instruction text, question/answer format, and confidence elicitation are identical.

### 5. Single-axis swap check (CONFIRMED — only model changes)
Dataset: TriviaQA rc.nocontext, same TRIVIAQA_ARROW path
Split: same split_manifest.json (idx-based, 6k/2k/2k)
Method: L2-logistic, C sweep {0.001,0.01,0.1,1,10}, lbfgs, n_bootstrap=200, seed=42
Threshold: same stage15_variance.json binarize_threshold
L* rule: max(normalized_dev_auc_c + normalized_dev_auc_v) for L>=1
All frozen as intended. ONLY the model path changes.

### 6. Success criteria (CONFIRMED — frozen from C3a)
abs_cos_at_Lstar <= 0.3, ci_upper_95 < 0.4, neighborhood_mean <= 0.3,
probe_c_auroc >= 0.70, probe_v_auroc >= 0.70 — all unchanged.

